          "text": "### Collateral System"
        },
        {
          "line": 113,
          "text": "The exchange trades in **PMCT** (PolyMarket Collateral Token), an ERC20 wrapper around USDC/USDCe:"
        },
        {
          "line": 114,
          "text": "- **CollateralOnramp**: Wraps supported assets into PMCT"
        },
        {
          "line": 115,
          "text": "- **CollateralOfframp**: Unwraps PMCT back to supported assets"
        },
        {
          "line": 116,
          "text": "- **CtfCollateralAdapter**: Bridges PMCT ↔ CTF operations (split/merge/redeem)"
        },
        {
          "line": 125,
          "text": "- **Wrapped collateral (PMCT)** — New collateral token layer with onramp/offramp, replacing direct USDC usage. Enables the collateral adapter pattern for CTF interactions."
